{
    "title": "Screen Time - StayFree",
    "description": "<b>StayFree - Screen Time & Limit App Usage</b> is THE companion on your journey towards productivity and self control. Whether you are a light phone user just looking for some interesting stats or a heavy phone user that is looking to break phone addiction, EVERYONE can benefit from understanding their screen time and digital wellbeing. \r\n\r\nStayFree can help you block apps and set thoughtful limits on your usage; schedule time away from your phone throughout the day; view simple breakdowns of your usage history to get a base understanding of how you use your phone; and explore detailed usage patterns to dive deep and unlock your full productivity potential.\r\n\r\n\u2726 <b>What makes StayFree special?</b> \r\n\r\n\u2714 We are the highest rated screen time, app blocker, and self control app\r\n\u2714 View and analyze your screen time across all of your devices. We have apps for Windows, Mac, Chrome/Firefox browsers, and any device you own\r\n\u2714 Extremely fast and user-friendly interface. Easily understand the basics or take a deeper dive into your screen time\r\n\u2714 Most accurate usage statistics\r\n\u2714 No impact on your battery \r\n\u2714 Totally <b>ad-free</b>!\r\n\u2714 Quick customer support for those that need it\r\n\r\nStayFree - Screen Time Tracker & Limit App Usage helps you:\r\n\ud83d\udcf5 overcome phone addiction\r\n\ud83d\udcaa reduce wasted time with a digital detox\r\n\ud83d\udd0b stay focused, reduce distractions, and boost productivity\r\n\ud83d\ude0c find self-control\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 reduce screen time\r\n\ud83e\udd33 unplug more often\r\n\ud83d\udcc8 increase your digital wellbeing\r\n\ud83d\udc6a spend quality time with family or yourself\r\n\r\n\u2726 <b>A taste of the app's features:</b>\r\n\r\n\u2605 Detailed usage history: view charts and statistics of your usage across all your devices.\r\n\u2605 Cross platform: easily and quickly connect devices to view total screen time (without creating an account!).\r\n\u2605 Over-use reminders: notify you when you are spending too much time in an app and start your digital detox.\r\n\u2605 Block apps: temporarily (or permanently) block any application that you are over-using.\r\n\u2605 Focus mode: create schedules to block distracting apps at specific times.\r\n\u2605 Sleep mode: disable all apps to allow you to unwind at the end of the day.\r\n\u2605 Website usage: see you which websites you actually used instead of just seeing an entry for your browser.\r\n\u2605 Export usage: save a CSV file if you want to customize your analysis or tailor it to yourself.\r\n\u2605 Avoid cheating: require a password to change any app settings.\r\n\u2605 Widget: show most used apps and total usage on a nice widget.\r\n\r\n\u2726 <b>Install StayFree across all your devices</b>\r\n\r\nStayFree has a Windows, MacOS, and Linux app to track your usage on any desktop computer! We also have a Chrome, Firefox, and Safari extension to help you understand detailed website usage and a Wear OS app for your watch. Connect all your devices to get a complete picture of your usage history and sync usage limits across your device group for a unified blocking experience. \r\n\r\nEven if you don't think that you need to block apps on your computer, having StayFree installed will give you more ways to explore your usage. Connecting your devices is the best way to experience the app!\r\n\r\nTo download StayFree on other platforms, check out our website: https://stayfreeapps.com?download\r\n\r\n\u2726 <b>YOU ARE IMPORTANT</b>\r\n\r\nWe'd really appreciate it if you could rate us 5 stars here on Google Play. Ratings are important for establishing trust with our user base. If you have suggestions or want to see something improved, don't hesitate to reach out: support@stayfreeapps.com\r\n\r\n\u2726<b>This app uses Accessibility Services</b>\r\n\r\nAndroid's Accessibility Services are used for detecting which website you are on and, in turn, blocking the websites you have requested to block. Enabling the Accessibility Service also improves the reliability of our usage limits. All information is maintained in accordance with our Privacy Policy and Sensor Tower is using the respective permissions with active consent by the end-user.\r\n\r\n\r\nStayFree is built by Sensor Tower.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>StayFree - Screen Time &amp; Limit App Usage</b> is THE companion on your journey towards productivity and self control. Whether you are a light phone user just looking for some interesting stats or a heavy phone user that is looking to break phone addiction, EVERYONE can benefit from understanding their screen time and digital wellbeing. <br><br>StayFree can help you block apps and set thoughtful limits on your usage; schedule time away from your phone throughout the day; view simple breakdowns of your usage history to get a base understanding of how you use your phone; and explore detailed usage patterns to dive deep and unlock your full productivity potential.<br><br>\u2726 <b>What makes StayFree special?</b> <br><br>\u2714 We are the highest rated screen time, app blocker, and self control app<br>\u2714 View and analyze your screen time across all of your devices. We have apps for Windows, Mac, Chrome/Firefox browsers, and any device you own<br>\u2714 Extremely fast and user-friendly interface. Easily understand the basics or take a deeper dive into your screen time<br>\u2714 Most accurate usage statistics<br>\u2714 No impact on your battery <br>\u2714 Totally <b>ad-free</b>!<br>\u2714 Quick customer support for those that need it<br><br>StayFree - Screen Time Tracker &amp; Limit App Usage helps you:<br>\ud83d\udcf5 overcome phone addiction<br>\ud83d\udcaa reduce wasted time with a digital detox<br>\ud83d\udd0b stay focused, reduce distractions, and boost productivity<br>\ud83d\ude0c find self-control<br>\ud83d\udcf1 reduce screen time<br>\ud83e\udd33 unplug more often<br>\ud83d\udcc8 increase your digital wellbeing<br>\ud83d\udc6a spend quality time with family or yourself<br><br>\u2726 <b>A taste of the app&#39;s features:</b><br><br>\u2605 Detailed usage history: view charts and statistics of your usage across all your devices.<br>\u2605 Cross platform: easily and quickly connect devices to view total screen time (without creating an account!).<br>\u2605 Over-use reminders: notify you when you are spending too much time in an app and start your digital detox.<br>\u2605 Block apps: temporarily (or permanently) block any application that you are over-using.<br>\u2605 Focus mode: create schedules to block distracting apps at specific times.<br>\u2605 Sleep mode: disable all apps to allow you to unwind at the end of the day.<br>\u2605 Website usage: see you which websites you actually used instead of just seeing an entry for your browser.<br>\u2605 Export usage: save a CSV file if you want to customize your analysis or tailor it to yourself.<br>\u2605 Avoid cheating: require a password to change any app settings.<br>\u2605 Widget: show most used apps and total usage on a nice widget.<br><br>\u2726 <b>Install StayFree across all your devices</b><br><br>StayFree has a Windows, MacOS, and Linux app to track your usage on any desktop computer! We also have a Chrome, Firefox, and Safari extension to help you understand detailed website usage and a Wear OS app for your watch. Connect all your devices to get a complete picture of your usage history and sync usage limits across your device group for a unified blocking experience. <br><br>Even if you don&#39;t think that you need to block apps on your computer, having StayFree installed will give you more ways to explore your usage. Connecting your devices is the best way to experience the app!<br><br>To download StayFree on other platforms, check out our website: https://stayfreeapps.com?download<br><br>\u2726 <b>YOU ARE IMPORTANT</b><br><br>We&#39;d really appreciate it if you could rate us 5 stars here on Google Play. Ratings are important for establishing trust with our user base. If you have suggestions or want to see something improved, don&#39;t hesitate to reach out: support@stayfreeapps.com<br><br>\u2726<b>This app uses Accessibility Services</b><br><br>Android&#39;s Accessibility Services are used for detecting which website you are on and, in turn, blocking the websites you have requested to block. Enabling the Accessibility Service also improves the reliability of our usage limits. All information is maintained in accordance with our Privacy Policy and Sensor Tower is using the respective permissions with active consent by the end-user.<br><br><br>StayFree is built by Sensor Tower.",
